{"id":"643611","name":"糖烤栗子","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/643611/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"板栗","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"用刀在板栗身上划个口放入水中煮20分钟。","img":"images/643611/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"捞出来。","img":"images/643611/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量的白糖。","img":"images/643611/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量的油。","img":"images/643611/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量清水泡1小时。期间不停翻动。","img":"images/643611/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将板栗码匀在烤盘上200度烤20分钟。","img":"images/643611/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"已经开口了。但还是没有熟透。","img":"images/643611/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"在此泡在糖油水中30分钟。","img":"images/643611/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烤箱200度25分钟。","img":"images/643611/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"已经开口来，一起吃板栗吧！","img":"images/643611/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：养生壶、烤箱、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}